%% frame: UC9 E5: two administrators save the same listing (design)
sequenceDiagram
    actor A1 as Admin 1
    actor A2 as Admin 2
    participant Ctl as :AdminListingController
    participant TA as txA : AdminListingAppServiceImpl
    participant TB as txB : AdminListingAppServiceImpl
    participant Repo as :ProductRepositoryImpl
    participant Map as :BizProductMapper
    participant P3 as v3 : Product
    participant P4 as v4 : Product

    Note over A1,P4: B5: both read the listing at version 3, then both save with expectedVersion 3
    par txA: Admin 1's save
        A1->>Ctl: revise(productId, request)
        Ctl->>TA: revise(id, detailsA, 3, admin1)
        critical txA: REQUIRED, READ COMMITTED, 10 s
            TA->>Repo: lockById(id)
            Repo->>Map: selectActiveByIdForUpdate(id): row lock
            Repo-->>TA: v3, row locked
            TA->>P3: requireVersion(3)
            TA->>P3: revise(detailsA)
            P3-->>TA: v4 (a new Product)
            TA->>Repo: updateListing(v4, 3, admin1)
            Repo->>Map: updateListing(row, 3, admin1)
            Map-->>Repo: 1 row
            Repo->>Repo: requireChanged(1)
            Note over TA,Map: txA commits; the row lock is released
        end
        TA-->>Ctl: ManagedListing, version 4
        Ctl-->>A1: AdminListingResponse, version 4
    and txB: Admin 2's save, at the same time
        A2->>Ctl: revise(productId, request)
        Ctl->>TB: revise(id, detailsB, 3, admin2)
        critical txB: REQUIRED, READ COMMITTED, 10 s
            TB->>Repo: lockById(id)
            Repo->>Map: selectActiveByIdForUpdate(id)
            Note over TB,Map: txB waits on the product row until txA commits
            Repo-->>TB: v4, row locked
            TB->>P4: requireVersion(3)
            P4-->>TB: E5: PRODUCT_VERSION_CONFLICT, currentVersion 4
            Note over TB,Map: txB rolls back; nothing written
        end
        TB-->>Ctl: BizException
        Ctl-->>A2: 412 with currentVersion 4
    end
    Note over A2,Ctl: E5: conflict banner; Admin 2 reloads version 4 and saves again
